From: "Claude (via Latorrey Whitehead)" <claude@anthropic.local>
Date: Sat, 4 Jul 2026 14:51:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Standardize all 10 verticals on canonical
 TSM.relay.write/read

War-room fixes:
- approval/catalog/cpq/crm/o2c: dedupe double writeRelay() call, migrate to
  TSM.relay.write(DOMAIN, payload)
- bpo: fix mismatched relay key (bpo_war -> BPO), dedupe, migrate to canonical
- governance/mdm/digital-twin/integration-hub: fix mismatched relay keys
  (gov->GOVERNANCE, twin->DIGITAL_TWIN, integration->INTEGRATION), migrate to
  canonical, and capture previously-dropped AI analysis text into the relay
  payload (ai_analysis field) so strategist/exec views have something to show
- remove now-unused legacy tsm-relay-core.js include from all 10 war-room files

Strategist + executive-portal pages (20 files):
- replace broken 18-line stubs (syntax error: const TSM_APPROVAL_RELAY with
  no assignment, crashed to blank page) with real dashboards
- generic relay reader with TSM.relay.read(DOMAIN) + raw-localStorage fallback
- KPI tiles driven by each vertical's actual computeKpis()/buildRelayPayload()
  field shapes, pulled from the real engine/war-room source, not placeholders
- attention/breach/risk list rendering, AI analysis/summary display
- executive-portal adds acknowledge/escalate action affordances
- live re-render on storage + TSM_RELAY_EVENT

Verified:
- all 30 changed files parse clean under the repo's parse-gate.yml check
- write/read domain keys verified to match relay.core.js RELAY_REGISTRY
  exactly for all 10 verticals (script-checked)
- server.js still passes node --check
- pre-existing parse-gate failures in other verticals (healthcare, legal,
  construction, financial-command, etc.) are untouched and out of scope
